OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French presents a concert
OL,6,     Ggiven in Lisbon by Hesperion XXI,
OL,7,     Gdirected by Jordi Savall,
OL,8,     Gfeaturing consort music by
OL,9,     Gcomposers such as Dowland,
OL,10,     GPurcell, Bach, Ferrabosco & Lawes.
OL,11,G1800FWords and Music
OL,12,     GIn her autobiography, Agatha
OL,13,     GChristie details her singing and
OL,14,     Gpiano lessons and her hopes of
OL,15,     Gbecoming a professional
OL,16,     Gperformer; and music features in
OL,17,     Gthe plots of her novels.
