OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,5,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,6,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,7,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,8,     Gweek, Gillian explores the
OL,9,     Gremarkable musical aesthetics of
OL,10,     GHelmut Lachenmann.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330FUnclassified
OL,18,     GElizabeth Alker takes us on
OL,19,     Ganother late-night journey
OL,20,     Gthrough fresh music from today's
OL,21,     Gmost exciting genre-defying
OL,22,     Gartists.
